led observations. A final scoped repeat now waits for ten quiet samples before launching, then records compiler activity throughout; no other process is stopped or reprioritized.\n\nThe shared ABI working tree acquired concurrent unrelated lint/workflow edits after publication. They are outside this task and untouched. Its isolated css-conditional-queries worktree remains clean at e1039c3, and the final SDK addon was built against that isolated snapshot before restoring the relative Cargo path. Retain that binary/source identity for benchmark and CI claims.","files":null}]}